    slug: "insurance-leads-near-me",
    title: "Insurance Leads Near Me: Understanding Local Search Intent",
    metaTitle: "Insurance Leads Near Me Guide",
    excerpt: "A guide to understanding and capturing local, geo-targeted insurance lead search intent.",
    metaDescription: "A guide to understanding and capturing local, geo-targeted insurance lead search intent, covering how location-based demand shapes pricing and conversion.",
